  {
   "id": "codex/talons_of_the_emperor/rites_of_war/the_hykanatoi",
   "name": "The Hykanatoi",
   "page": 15,
   "url": "https://longwarindex.app/rites_of_war/the_hykanatoi/",
   "offered_by": {
    "codex": "talons_of_the_emperor"
   },
   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your Army must include 2 units of Custodian Guard.\n- Your Warlord must be a Shield Captain.\n- Your Shield Captain may not be equipped with a Dawn Eagle Jetbike or Allarus Terminator Armour.\n- For every Custodes unit in your army, you must include 1 Sisters of Silence unit.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may select a second unit in your Army to be a Warlord that does not have the Custodes Keyword. Both units are considered to be your Warlord. The chosen second unit may generate a Warlord trait.\n- One unit of Custodian Guard in your army may be upgraded to be Heteron Guard for 10pts per model (see below).\n- Custodian Guard & Shield Captain units in your army may exchange their Guardian Spears for:\n    - An Adrasite Spear for 10pts (see below).\n    - A Pyrithite Spear for 15pts (see below).\n\nHeteron Guard: +10pts per model\n\nOne unit of Custodian Guard in your army may be upgraded to be Heteron Guard for 10pts per model in the unit. A unit of Heteron Guard increases their Weapon Skill (WS), Ballistic Skill (BS) and Initiative (I) characteristics by 1.",
   "restrictions": [
    {
     "id": "the_hykanatoi_custodian_guard",
     "printed": "Your Army must include 2 units of Custodian Guard.",
     "scope": "detachment",
     "units": {
