       {
        "keyword": "Custodes"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "the_tharantoi_infantry_terminator_or_sagittarum",
     "printed": "All Infantry units in your army must have the Terminator Keyword or be Sagittarum Guard.",
