   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your army must have the Custodes Keyword.\n- Your army must include a Shield Captain equipped with a Dawn Eagle Jetbike.\n- Your army must include at least 2 units of Venatari Custodians.\n- All units in your army that do not have the Fly special rule must begin the game in Deep Strike or Embarked in a Transport with the Fly special rule.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may field Venatari Custodians as Troops choices.\n- You may ignore the Limited: 1 Per Detachment special rule on Vertus Praetor units in your army.\n- You may field Ares Gunships as Heavy Support Choices.\n- You may field Orion Assault Dropships as Dedicated Transports.",
